  quantity-constraint-within
    defined-by comparison
    role quantity-constraint-outcome
    precondition "An explicitly requested same-unit sum and bound are resolved, and the sum is less than or equal to the bound."
    effect "Report an affirmative inclusive-comparison result while retaining the computed quantities and source evidence."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The bound is 10 kg. The amounts are 4 kg and 6 kg. Is their sum within the bound? => Yes."
    lexeme en "within the explicit bound"
    lexeme ru "в пределах явно заданной границы"
    lexeme hi "स्पष्ट सीमा के भीतर"
    lexeme zh "不超过明确给出的界限"
    lexeme es "dentro del límite explícito"

  quantity-constraint-exceeds
    defined-by comparison
    role quantity-constraint-outcome
    precondition "An explicitly requested same-unit sum and bound are resolved, and the sum is greater than the bound."
    effect "Report a negative inclusive-comparison result while retaining the computed quantities and source evidence."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The bound is 9 kg. The amounts are 4 kg and 6 kg. Is their sum within the bound? => No."
    lexeme en "exceeds the explicit bound"
    lexeme ru "превышает явно заданную границу"
    lexeme hi "स्पष्ट सीमा से अधिक"
    lexeme zh "超过明确给出的界限"
    lexeme es "supera el límite explícito"

  quantity-constraint-unknown
    defined-by comparison
    role quantity-constraint-outcome
    precondition "The explicit comparison is owned, but a required quantity, unit, frame or arithmetic result is unresolved."
    effect "Decline the comparison without emitting a true or false quantity verdict or an unrelated numeric conversion."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The bound is 10 kg. The amounts depend on an unstated condition. Is their sum within the bound? => unresolved."
    lexeme en "unresolved explicit comparison"
    lexeme ru "неопределённое явное сравнение"
    lexeme hi "अनिर्णीत स्पष्ट तुलना"
    lexeme zh "尚未确定的明确比较"
    lexeme es "comparación explícita sin resolver"

  limit
    defined-by quantity
    defined-by comparison
    role quantity-constraint-bound-reference
    precondition "An explicit inclusive quantity constraint states the greatest allowed quantity and its unit."
    effect "Use that stated quantity as an inclusive upper bound; do not infer a mathematical limiting process, an execution order or an unstated allowance."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The limit is 10 kg. => a sum of 10 kg is within the stated limit."
    source "data/cache/wordnet/en/limit.json#oewn-13780436-n"
    license "CC BY 4.0"
    lexeme en limit
    lexeme ru "предел"
    lexeme hi "संख्यात्मक ऊपरी सीमा"
    lexeme zh "限额"
    lexeme es "límite"

  budget
    defined-by limit
    role quantity-constraint-bound-reference
    precondition "The word is used as the bound reference inside a recognized explicit quantity constraint."
    effect "Interpret this scoped reference as the stated upper bound, without inferring a financial plan or scheduling rule."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The budget is 1200 ms. => the named upper bound is 1200 ms."
    lexeme en budget
    lexeme ru "бюджет"
    lexeme hi "बजट"
    lexeme zh "预算"
    lexeme es "presupuesto"

  capacity
    defined-by limit
    role quantity-constraint-bound-reference
    precondition "The word is used as the bound reference inside a recognized explicit quantity constraint."
    effect "Interpret this scoped reference as the maximum permitted quantity in the stated unit, not as evidence of execution order."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The capacity is 10 kg. => the named upper bound is 10 kg."
    lexeme en capacity
    lexeme ru "ёмкость"
    lexeme hi "क्षमता"
    lexeme zh "容量"
    lexeme es "capacidad"

  amounts
