    precondition "The plural word names the explicitly listed members of a quantity constraint."
    effect "Refer to the listed numeric quantities, each of which retains its own unit and source span."
    unit "not applicable"
    example "The amounts are 4 kg and 6 kg. => the two stated quantities are 4 kg and 6 kg."
    lexeme en amounts
    lexeme ru "величины"
    lexeme hi "राशियाँ"
    lexeme zh "数值"
    lexeme es "valores"

